    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Duelists is an 8 player Battle-Royale/Roguelike in which players duel it out to be the last man standing. The game starts by generating a unique dungeon and letting the players choose starting locations based on a few hotspots on the map. Players gather gear by fighting enemies and opening chests while progressing through the dungeon while a large clock counts down. Players race against the clock to get as strong as possible because when that clock hits 0 all players are teleported to a 1-vs-1 arena and forced to fight to the death. When the stronger player wins the fight, the other player is eliminated and the winner will be teleported back to the dungeon and continue to gather gear while the countdown starts over again. This keeps happening until there is only one player left and that player is the victor.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Duelists is an 8 player Battle-Royale/Roguelike in which players duel it out to be the last man standing. The game starts by generating a unique dungeon and letting the players choose starting locations based on a few hotspots on the map. Players gather gear by fighting enemies and opening chests while progressing through the dungeon while a large clock counts down. Players race against the clock to get as strong as possible because when that clock hits 0 all players are teleported to a 1-vs-1 arena and forced to fight to the death. When the stronger player wins the fight, the other player is eliminated and the winner will be teleported back to the dungeon and continue to gather gear while the countdown starts over again. This keeps happening until there is only one player left and that player is the victor.</p>",
    "short_description": "Battle Royale meets Dungeon Crawler: 8 warriors clash in a brutal, loot-driven fight to the death!",
